      en: ["A cold case from 1998 sits on your desk. Your 84-year-old neighbour, Mrs. Pickett, reads it over your shoulder: 'It's the gardener. Obviously.'", "You've been stuck on a jewellery theft for six months. Mrs. Pickett, your neighbour who's watched crime shows since 1962, offers to 'take a look'."],
