      en: ["Last day of shooting. The $3 million animatronic dragon just caught fire. The lead actor is screaming that he's burning out. The producer isn't picking up.", "Final scene of your blockbuster: the mechanical dragon breathes fire on the hero. Take 1: it torches the caterer. The buffet is burning. The dragon keeps going."],
