      en: ["Wedding, midnight. Drunk Uncle Gary grabs your mic and starts a speech: 'Personally, I liked Kevin's ex, she was more…' The room freezes. Your hand is on the deck.", "You're DJing a wedding. The bride's uncle commandeers the mic to talk about 'the groom's ex, who was honestly prettier'. Everyone looks at you."],
