      en: ["Downward dog, total silence. You feel a fart of biblical proportions rising. Fifteen students are breathing deeply three feet from your butt.", "Guided meditation. 'Breathe in… breathe out…' A long, high-pitched, endless fart crosses the room like a deflating balloon. Everyone opens their eyes. It was you."],
