      en: ["A sobbing client dropped her engagement ring down the toilet. Her fiancé arrives in an hour. The toilet's been clogged since this morning. Full. Of everything.", "Emergency: a $10,000 wedding ring is stuck in a restaurant toilet trap after a seafood service. The owner hands you gloves. They have holes."],
